  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened Border Management to Promote Cross-Border Mobility and Counter Transnational Crimes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at supporting the Government of Bangladesh in its effort to strengthen the border control and migration management systems by improving the efficiency of operations at border control points, reinforce regional cooperation and information exchange mechanisms. The project will pursue two distinct but complementary Outcomes: improved technical capabilities of immigration authorities through the provision of equipment, software and other support; and strengthened border authorities&#x2019; skills and knowledge in effective border control, tackling cross border crimes and countering migrant smuggling through institutional capacity building.</narrative>
  </description>
